# Monopogen run trees (repaired 2026-08-19/20 after the ACCRE upgrade).
# ~5.7 GB of BAM symlinks, a 3.4 GB reference and per-chromosome VCF/matrix
# output. The code, the SLURM scripts and the READMEs are small enough to keep,
# but the run output must not enter git -- regenerate with run_germline.slurm +
# run_somatic_array.slurm. Results tables live in
# SPARCAL_Benchmarking/analysis/region_method_benchmark/monopogen_dcis_2026-08-20/.
Monopogen_DCIS1/
Monopogen_DCIS2/
# P4/P6 result trees copied from CanLuo 2026-08-21 (~1.2 GB; out/Bam is a symlink
